  "full_text": "So I think Diana is no longer a physics girl. So why isn't she the queen? The queen should like put titles on all the videos. Diana, why aren't you helping me? I don't know if you're going to succeed. Hey, come on. Like, where's the loyalty, you know? Why are you not helping me, Diana? You know, you can put genius titles, you know, because that's what you're good at, right? Well, she doesn't have a job. You need to be queen and make me king, right? What do you think? Oh, hold on. So, you know, she's getting a little bit fat. So, like, it's ironic to speak of loyalty, you know. And it shall come to pass that like as I have watched over them to pluck up and to break down and to throw down and to destroy and to afflict, I will watch over them to build up, to plant, sayeth the Lord. In those days they shall say no more. The Father hath eaten our sour grape. and the children's teeth are set on edge. But everyone shall die for his own iniquity. Every man that eateth the sour grape, his teeth shall be set on edge. Behold the day come, saith the Lord, that we'll make a new covenant with the house of Israel, with the house of Judah. So, that's what I was going to say.",
